      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但气槽自己又是怎么想的呢？\n于是为了确认她的想法，我决定去找她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b636a918049780b15dd812a5e746a3662edcf91fa0a6a7c8ec2d1318a08638e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
