      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想必今后她在为了赛马娘奉献己身的同时，\n也会约束自己，朝着更高处迈进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfe353fbae07a383bb60e38b2ce566375f21c9c8bcecc65bd79e1d433621c68",
